Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:48.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《黑夜传说》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:03.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争, 一眨眼的功夫就停止了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war had all but ground to a halt in the blink of an eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩, 狼人中最可怕及残暴的领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian, the most feared and ruthless leader ever to rule the Lycan clan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...had finally been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在一个充满了火焰和复仇的夜晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycan horde scattered to the wind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人族从此变成游民随风流亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a single evening of flame and retribution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:27.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,表面看来我们已经胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victory, it seemed, was in our grasp...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:30.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼终于可以安然存活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the very birthright of the Vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:38.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚之后, 转眼又过了六个世纪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nearly six centuries had passed since that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:44.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那远古的血腥争斗却没有跟随卢西恩一起进入坟墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet the ancient feud proved unwilling to follow Lucian to the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管狼人的数目已减少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though Lycans were fewer in number...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但战争本身还是越来越危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the war itself had become more perilous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:52.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不再受月亮的控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the moon no longer held her sway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:58.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,古老强大的狼人可以随意改变身体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Older, more powerful Lycans were now able to change at will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:02.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然武器进步了, 但是我们的目标仍旧是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The weapons had evolved, but our orders remained the same{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:06.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狩猎他们, 杀死他们, 一个接一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hunt them down and kill them off, one by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最成功的战役{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A most successful campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:14.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能太过成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps too successful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:27.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我这样一个死亡行者而言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For those like me, a Death Dealer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这标志着一个时代的结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this signaled the end of an era.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就如同上个世纪的武器一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the weapons of the previous century...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:35.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们同样会被废弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we, too, would become obsolete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:39.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜, 因为我靠它而活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity, because I lived for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloods!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:52.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事, 没事, 你会好起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. It's all right. You're gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:25.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就像是一群疯狗！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're acting like a pack of rabid dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么, 各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that, gentlemen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:31.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以后别这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...simply will not do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:36.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想在吸血鬼的地盘上打垮他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you expect to defeat the Vampires on their own ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:40.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想活下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you expect to survive at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,皮尔斯！泰勒！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pierce! Taylor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把衣服穿上好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put some clothes on, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:30.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇到个严重的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a serious problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得做些试验了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to run a few tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:50.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它肯定是某种光子流的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's definitely an irradiated fluid of some sort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,紫外线武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ultraviolet ammunition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:55.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,利用日光作为武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daylight, harnessed as a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:58.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我相信一个恶心的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect me to believe that a mangy animal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:13:01.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会用高科技装备的子弹去射杀吸血鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...came up with a bullet specifically engineered to kill Vampires?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不, 我打赌那是军用技术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm betting it's military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:07.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们偷了些东西, 一些高科技追踪装置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something they stole. Some sort of high-tech tracer round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不关心他们从哪儿得到这些玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care where they got these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞吉儿死了, 纳撒尼尔还在外边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rigel is dead, and Nathaniel could still be out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:14.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,集合所有的死亡行者, 撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should gather the Death Dealers and get back down therefore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能撤…不能因为一次偶然入侵就撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely not. Not now. Not for a random incursion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:22.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唤醒是几天后的事, 这所房子已动荡不安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Awakening is a few days off, and this house is in unrest as it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:25.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,偶然的？大家都看见了他们在向我们开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Random? They opened fire on us in full view of the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 而且我在那条隧道里听到了 - 你说过你什么都没看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And from what I heard in that tunnel... - You said you didn't see anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:33.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我清楚听到什么, 也知道心里想什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I heard, and I know what my gut tells me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下面有一大群狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am telling you there could be dozens of Lycans down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:38.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能更多, 谁知道, 也许成百上千{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows, maybe more. Hundreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:41.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,经过我们的猎杀, 他们几近灭绝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've hunted them to the brink of extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:45.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩是对的, 瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kraven's right, Selene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很久以来都没有过那么大的洞穴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not been a den of that magnitude for centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 自从卢西恩时代起就没有过 - 这我知道, 卡恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not since the days of Lucian.  - I know that, Kahn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:54.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我希望在你检查之后, 再告诉我那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'd rather you prove me wrong by checking it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 让你的人待命！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.Have your men tighten things up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让索伦组织一个搜索小队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have Soren assemble a search team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:05.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不, 我来带队吧 - 绝对不行, 让索伦负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I want to lead the team myself.  - Absolutely not! Soren will handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:08.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上百只, 真的那么多吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundreds, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:10.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多会相信我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor would believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我从没那样对待过你 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd never treat you like that.  - Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:23.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在去看看她是否打扮好能够见客人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now run along and make sure she's dressed and ready for her guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:36.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道, 这是在浪费时间 - 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a waste of time, you know. - What is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:40.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怀疑维克多想让你在这一直盯着他的坟墓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt Viktor would want you freezing in here, staring at his tomb for hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不, 他是想让死亡行者去搜索城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he'd want the Death Dealers out there, scouring every inch of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:49.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩, 我搞不懂为什么维克多让他负责这事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kraven. I'll never understand why Viktor left him in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:52.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个官僚, 不是个战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a bureaucrat, not a warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, We need to get you ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为了什么？ - 舞会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what?  - The party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:16:00.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿米莉亚的使节随时随地都会出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia's envoy will be here any minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦, 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定得穿上这个, 真是完美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should definitely wear this one. It's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要找的是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:39.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很有魅力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's attractive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 作为一个人来说 - 谁很有魅力？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...for a human.  - Who's attractive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天晚上我计划让你在我身边待着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I planned to have you at my side this evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带上艾丽卡, 她渴望在你身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Erika. She's dying to be at your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:09.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你问我, 我要说你把战斗看得太重了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ask me, you take this warrior business far too seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:14.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法改变过去, 无论你杀了多少人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't undo the past, no matter how many you kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除此之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:19.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你拒绝生活中简单的乐趣的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what's the point in being immortal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永生又有什么意义呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you deny yourself life's simple pleasures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:24.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见这个人了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see this human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了？ - 我感觉是狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What of him?  - I'm beginning to think the Lycans...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:29.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:38.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点穿的端庄高贵些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on something elegant and be quick about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩, 我是认真的, 我觉得他们在跟着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kraven, I'm serious. I think they were following him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:47.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了获取食物, 狼人跟踪人类干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other than food, why would Lycans stalk a human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:02.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有进展吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any progress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:05.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:14.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:32.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你回家？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heading home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:36.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊, 尼古拉斯给了我几个小时的假{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Nicholas gave me a couple hours off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:41.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说今晚你在手术室干得不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he said you did a terrific job tonight with the surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:43.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:47.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被伏击了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were ambushed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三个死亡行者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Dealers, three of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.00,0:21:50.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个目标呢？ - 我们跟丢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the candidate?  - We lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:51.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟丢了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:55.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银球, 银含量很高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ag rounds. High content.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:22:00.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阻止他起变化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prevented him from making the change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:09.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,挖出其它的也没用了, 银已穿透他组织器官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No use in digging out the rest. Silver's penetrated his organs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:12.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在再想修复已经不可能了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regeneration's impossible at this point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.40,0:22:16.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这些东西拿出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take these out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:23.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼不会想到你会跟踪一个人类的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vampires didn't realize you were following a human...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:35.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对吧, 瑞兹？ - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...did they, Raze?  - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:39.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是, 我不这么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:43.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不这么想, 还是你根本就不知道？ - 我不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't think, or you don't know?  - I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:06.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的要去看看这个迈克尔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really must have a look at this Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.40,0:23:11.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事情都要我亲自动手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must I do everything myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.50,0:23:26.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们被大海分割{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our noble houses may be separated by a great ocean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:31.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们有同样的血统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but we are equally committed to the survival of the bloodlines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:35.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当阿米莉亚到了并唤醒了马库斯时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when Amelia arrives to awaken Marcus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:38.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩两天的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in just two days' time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:43.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将会再一次的团结在一起了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we shall once again be united as a single coven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:51.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想多谢主人的盛情款待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want to thank our hosts for their generous hospitality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:26.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(姓名：迈克尔·柯文 | 住址：3B街区 510号)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.30,0:24:57.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了, 他做了他该做的事然后回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He comes in, he does his job and then he goes home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.00,0:25:00.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了这些, 我也不知道该告诉你什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other than that, I really don't know what to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.90,0:25:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,日夜不停地工作, 难道生活中就没别的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interns work around the clock. We don't have much of a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:06.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们在哪儿能找到他吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where we can find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.70,0:25:08.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:12.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以到他家去找找, 要不就在这等他回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can try him at home, or you'll have to wait till he gets back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:19.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没遇到什么麻烦吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not in some kind of trouble, is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.40,0:26:06.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是迈克尔, 我现在不在家, 请留下口讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Michael. I'm not in right now. Please leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔, 我是亚当, 警察正在医院找你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael, it's Adam. The police were just in the hospital looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.40,0:26:13.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们确信你卷入了一场枪击事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were convinced you were involved with a shootout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:16.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他们这不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told them there's no way you'd be involved with that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:19.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们还是在找你, 就在现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but they're looking for you. Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.50,0:26:25.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么抓你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are they after you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.90,0:26:52.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.50,0:27:38.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好, 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.80,0:29:08.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的到底发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.70,0:30:57.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停车！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.40,0:30:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后退！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:01.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.40,0:31:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好, 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.60,0:31:06.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你流了很多血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've lost a lot of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.30,0:31:15.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不停车的话, 我们都会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't stop the car, you'll get us both killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.30,0:31:20.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不是在胡闹！ - 我也不是！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not screwing around!  - Neither am I!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.30,0:31:22.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你的嘴, 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up and hold on. I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.50,0:31:29.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.00,0:33:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又逃脱了, 真是令人印象深刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A second escape. Impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.90,0:33:15.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能瑞兹没有夸大事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps Raze wasn't overstating matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.90,0:33:18.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞兹可没带回这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raze didn't bring back this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.20,0:33:34.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果迈克尔的确是我们要找的人, 那吸血鬼就会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Michael is indeed The Carrier, the Vampires could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.50,0:33:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张, 老伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.50,0:33:39.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我尝过他的肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've tasted his flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.50,0:33:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离月圆还有两天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just two days till full moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.20,0:33:45.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很快, 他就会成为一个狼人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, he will be a Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:49.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很快, 他就会来找我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, he will come looking for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.50,0:34:13.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很可惜我们没有更多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame we don't have more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.50,0:34:29.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,确实如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Positive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.70,0:35:18.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,躺着别动, 你的头被狠狠地敲了一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lay still. Your skull's taken a good knock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:21.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾短暂昏迷过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been unconscious for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.50,0:35:26.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么那些人追你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea why those men were after you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.40,0:35:28.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.80,0:35:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.80,0:35:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Selene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.90,0:35:52.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以, 起码这次谣言是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, for once, the rumors were true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.40,0:36:00.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整间房子的人都对你的新宠议论纷纷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole house has been absolutely buzzing about your new pet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:06.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你打算把他变成我们同类？ - 当然不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you going to try to turn him?  - Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.70,0:36:09.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么把他带到这儿来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why did you bring him here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.30,0:36:13.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他救过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.80,0:36:18.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么来这儿了？ - 克莱恩派我来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you here?  - Kraven sent me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.80,0:36:22.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想见你, 现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to see you. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.80,0:36:27.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会同意的！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is completely unacceptable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.20,0:36:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你违抗我的命令, 整晚离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go against my orders and spend the night away from the mansion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.50,0:36:36.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和一个人类在一起？居然还带到我这里来！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a human? A human you've since brought back to my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.50,0:36:40.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知, 这儿仍是维克多的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as I'm concerned, this is still Viktor's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.20,0:36:43.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道, 我不想吵架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't want to argue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:47.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道迈克尔对狼人来说有多重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need you understand that Michael is somehow important to the Lycans...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.20,0:36:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在叫迈克尔了！ - 能先听完我说的话吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So now it's "Michael"!  - Would you just hear me out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.70,0:36:54.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我难以理解为什么你执着于这个荒谬的理论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beyond me why you're so obsessed over this ridiculous theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.20,0:36:56.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩绝不会对一个人类有丝毫的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian wouldn't be a bit interested in a human...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.70,0:36:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论是迈克尔还是别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Michael or otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.60,0:37:03.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.70,0:37:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他让你着迷了, 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're infatuated with him, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.20,0:37:09.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这想法真荒谬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's a ridiculous theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是不是呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:38.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这儿！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你不会生我的气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure hope you never get pissed off with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.70,0:39:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,试试这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.80,0:39:27.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧, 射击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Squeeze off a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.20,0:39:42.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,退出弹夹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eject the mag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.70,0:39:49.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经克隆了狼人的子弹, 硝酸银{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've copied the Lycan rounds. Silver nitrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.70,0:39:51.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,足以致命的剂量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lethal dose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.20,0:39:54.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能像挖出一般子弹一样挖出这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't dig these out, like our usual rounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:58.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直接流入血液中, 什么也挖不出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight into the bloodstream. Ain't nothing to dig out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.20,0:40:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我, 卡恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Kahn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.20,0:40:06.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信卢西恩是像他们说的那样死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe Lucian died the way they say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.20,0:40:10.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 克莱恩又讲起战争故事了？ - 那是我的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kraven telling war stories again?  - That's my point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.70,0:40:13.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那只不过是个古老的故事, 他的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing but an ancient story. His story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.70,0:40:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了他说的, 没什么能证明他杀死卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not a shred of proof he killed Lucian, only his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.20,0:40:20.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没低估过克莱恩对进步的渴求程度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never underestimated Kraven's lust for advancement...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.20,0:40:23.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是维克多相信他, 那才是重点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but Viktor believed him and that's all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.20,0:40:26.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要带着这个东西去哪？ - 哪也不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where you going with this anyway?  - Nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.70,0:40:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和死亡行者公开交火, 并追击人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engaging Death Dealers in public and chasing after some human...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.60,0:40:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并不是我所想的, 你们应该开个店做掩护！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was not what I had in mind. You were told to set up shop and lay low!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.20,0:40:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点, 克莱恩！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm yourself, Kraven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.20,0:41:05.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类跟你无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The human doesn't concern you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.70,0:41:10.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且除此之外, 我已经藏头缩尾很久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides, I've laid low for quite long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.90,0:41:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,管好你的人, 卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep your men at bay, Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:25.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少从现在开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least for the time being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.70,0:41:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我为我们的交易后悔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't force me to regret our arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.70,0:41:32.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要尽好你自己的本份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just concentrate on your part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.70,0:41:37.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住, 我已经为你流过一次血了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, I've bled for you once already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.80,0:41:41.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没我, 你什么也做不成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without me, you'd have nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.10,0:41:44.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一无所有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:33.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在进攻卢西恩堡垒的全部勇士中间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of the scores of brave souls who entered Lucian's fortress...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.70,0:43:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个吸血鬼幸存下来了, 他就是克莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a single Vampire survived; Kraven...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.90,0:43:40.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他受到丰厚的奖赏, 不仅是因为他制造了大火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who was richly rewarded for not only setting the great blaze...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.10,0:43:45.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还因为他带回了狼人族首领死亡的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but for returning with evidence of the Lycan master's demise...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.10,0:43:50.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一块卢西恩胳膊上的有烙印的皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the branded skin, cut from Lucian's very arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.60,0:44:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在找你, 他被咬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking for you. He's been bitten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.60,0:44:25.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经被打上了狼人的标记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your human, he's been marked by a Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.10,0:44:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是克莱恩跟你说的吗？ - 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did Kraven put you up to this?  - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.50,0:44:33.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我亲眼看见了那个伤口, 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the wound with my own eyes, I swear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.30,0:44:37.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是盟约怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about the Covenant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.80,0:44:40.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道, 这个是不允许的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it's forbidden!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.50,0:44:50.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从他咬了我之后, 我就{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ever since he bit me, I've been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.50,0:44:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就有了这些幻想和错觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been having these hallucinations and these delusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.70,0:45:02.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我所知道的就是, 好像我的头裂成两半似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I know is, it feels like my skull is splitting in half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.10,0:45:05.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了, 一个成年男子咬了你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so a full-grown man bit you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.30,0:45:09.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.30,0:45:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定不是狗咬的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure this wasn't a dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:15.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了, 是个人, 是一个人！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, it was a man. It was a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.10,0:45:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好, 我明白了 - 他当时在追我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, I got it.  - He was after me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.90,0:45:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后地铁里的那个女人 - 什么女人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And that woman from the subway...  - What woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.80,0:45:25.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底听没听我说话？她把我当人质！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you been listening to me? She took me hostage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.30,0:45:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好, 我在听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.80,0:45:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just... Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.80,0:45:33.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会帮你弄清楚的, 好吗？我一会就回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll help you get this all sorted out, all right? I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.30,0:45:37.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放手, 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go, Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.60,0:45:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.10,0:45:44.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点, 好吗？我一会儿就回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just calm down, okay? I'm gonna be back in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.20,0:45:47.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我保证 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a promise.  - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.50,0:46:58.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please forgive me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.00,0:47:01.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我真的需要你的指导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I desperately need your guidance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.90,0:47:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卡恩想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kahn wants to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.20,0:48:51.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就我所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To my knowledge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.70,0:48:54.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唤醒仪式从未由像我这种辈分的人执行过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...an Awakening has never been attempted by one such as myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.70,0:48:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长老们都有能力组织他们的记忆和思想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The elders hold the power to organize their memories and thoughts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.30,0:49:01.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,变成一个连贯的影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...into a single, cohesive vision...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.90,0:49:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和详细的记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a detailed record of their reign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.10,0:49:09.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望维克多能听听我的恳求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only hope Viktor will hear my plea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.10,0:50:22.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅我, 但我真的需要你的指导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please forgive me, but I desperately need your guidance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.10,0:50:25.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉提前唤醒你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologize for awakening you ahead of schedule...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.90,0:50:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我担心我们可能处于非常危机之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I fear we may all be in grave danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.20,0:50:33.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是你, 我的主人, 你现在是如此虚弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially you, my lord, if left in your weakened state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.20,0:50:37.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我相信卢西恩仍活得好好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For I believe that Lucian is alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.20,0:50:41.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就在这个城市里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Now. In this very city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.50,0:50:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他准备在唤醒仪式上攻击我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...preparing to hit us during the Awakening ceremony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.90,0:50:48.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更让人头痛的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even more disturbing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.20,0:50:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我想的没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is that if I'm correct...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.70,0:50:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩跟卢西恩是一伙儿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it would mean that Kraven is in league with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.10,0:52:20.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事这么急？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so pressing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.90,0:52:22.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.70,0:52:43.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.70,0:52:45.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟瑟琳娜说话！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to speak with Selene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.70,0:52:50.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是迈克尔吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Michael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.10,0:52:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是迈克尔吗？ - 到底发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it Michael?  - What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.10,0:52:55.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到底怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.50,0:52:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.90,0:53:04.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你去见他, 你就别想再回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you go to him, you'll never be welcome in this house again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.20,0:53:11.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然维克多醒了, 看他对这件事会怎么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that Viktor's awake, we'll see what he has to say about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.30,0:53:25.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.30,0:53:54.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧, 我已警告过她了…警告过…可她不听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I warned her. I warned her, but she didn't listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.80,0:53:58.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我本该早点跟你说的 - 说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I should've told you sooner.  - Told me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.70,0:54:03.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她的那个人类, 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her human, Michael...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.20,0:54:06.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经不再是个人类了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's not a human at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.60,0:54:07.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.10,0:54:12.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.60,0:54:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事这么吵？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this ruckus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.70,0:54:23.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别再回来了, 他们会杀了你的, 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never come here again. They'll kill you.Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.50,0:54:26.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？你们是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Who are you people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.20,0:55:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.90,0:55:24.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不论你喜不喜欢, 你已加入了一场持续千年的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it or not, you're in the middle of a war that's raged for 1000 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.50,0:55:27.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼和狼人之间的族仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A blood feud between Vampires and Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.90,0:55:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Werewolves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.20,0:55:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider yourself lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.20,0:55:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不到一个小时, 被咬过的许多人类都会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most humans die within an hour of being bitten by an immortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.70,0:55:51.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们传播的病毒是致命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The viruses we transmit are deadly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.50,0:55:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你咬了我, 我也会变成吸血鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you bit me, I'd become a Vampire instead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.00,0:55:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不, 你会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you'd die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.00,0:55:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被两个种族咬过之后, 没人能幸存下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's ever survived a bite from both species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.90,0:56:02.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我该停下车, 然后杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By rights, I'd stop the car and kill you myself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.60,0:56:04.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么你要帮我？ - 我没有帮你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you helping me?  - I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.60,0:56:07.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟踪你, 然后杀死你的同类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I track down and kill your kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.10,0:56:10.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最想知道…为什么卢西恩这么想得到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only interest is finding out why Lucian wants you so badly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.50,0:56:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么我醒了, 我的仆人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know why I've been awakened, servant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.80,0:56:19.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道, 主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.20,0:56:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但我很快就会知道 - 等你找到她的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I'll soon find out.  - You mean when you find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.20,0:56:27.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的, 主人 - 你一定要让她来见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, my lord.  - You must let her come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.70,0:56:32.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很多事要谈, 瑟琳娜和我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have much to discuss, Selene and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.20,0:56:38.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她让我看到了很多麻烦事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has shown me a great many disturbing things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.20,0:56:42.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过这些事很快就会解决的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things that will be dealt with soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.70,0:56:46.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,家族越来越软弱和堕落了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This coven has grown weak, decadent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.20,0:56:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我本该换个人处理我的事务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I should have left someone else in charge of my affairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.20,0:56:59.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.70,0:57:02.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...her memories...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.00,0:57:04.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,仍旧是混乱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are chaotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.70,0:57:07.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对时间没有意识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sense of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.70,0:57:09.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主人, 请让我去召集支援吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, my lord, let me summon assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.20,0:57:11.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要的是休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in need of rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.60,0:57:15.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经休息够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've rested enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.20,0:57:19.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做的就是召唤马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you will do is summon Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.90,0:57:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他仍在休眠, 主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he still slumbers, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.00,0:57:31.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿米莉亚和理事会成员明天夜里到达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia and the Council members are arriving tomorrow night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.90,0:57:34.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以唤醒马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to awaken Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.50,0:57:36.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你, 我的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.40,0:57:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经提前整整一个世纪苏醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been awakened a full century ahead of schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.90,0:57:51.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个婊子背叛了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bitch has betrayed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.30,0:57:56.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他知道所有她困扰的事情了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he knows everything she's been obsessing about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.70,0:58:01.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.90,0:58:08.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能让我相信吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you to be trusted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.40,0:58:10.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.90,0:58:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,20分钟后在我住的地方等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet me in my quarters in 20 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.50,0:58:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候让你知道一些事情了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time I filled you in on a few things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.20,0:59:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见这些…这些幻象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm seeing these things, these hallucinations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.20,0:59:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们不是幻象, 是记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not hallucinations, they're memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.20,0:59:08.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你被咬过了, 他的记忆已经传递给你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been bitten. His memories have been passed to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.70,0:59:17.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们用来审问的地方之一, 很安全的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one of the places we use for interrogations. It should be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.20,0:59:34.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 苏迪斯产业公司 -  我们的产业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ziodex Industries.  - We own it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.50,0:59:37.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起先是人造血浆, 现在就是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First there was synthetic plasma, now this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.90,0:59:40.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦被许可, 它就会成为我们的最新商品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once it's approved, it should be our newest cash crop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.90,0:59:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是克隆血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cloned blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.50,0:59:49.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是作什么用的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are these for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.70,0:59:53.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人对银过敏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lycans are allergic to silver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.70,0:59:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若不尽快取出子弹, 他们就会在审讯中死掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't get our bullets out quickly, they die during questioning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.20,0:59:59.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来你要对他们作什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do with them after?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.20,1:00:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把子弹放回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We put the bullets back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.20,1:00:22.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 事情进展的如何？ - 都准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are things progressing?  - We're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.20,1:00:30.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你这么恨他们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you hate them so much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.20,1:00:33.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你了, 我们在作战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already told you, we're at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.20,1:00:35.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你只是按命令行事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're just following orders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.20,1:00:47.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不回答？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't you just answer the question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.30,1:00:52.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.20,1:00:55.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了一些事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something was in the stable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.20,1:00:58.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的马被撕成碎片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tearing our horses to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.20,1:01:01.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法救出我妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't have saved my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.80,1:01:04.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和我的妹妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.70,1:01:08.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们的尖叫声惊醒了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their screams woke me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.20,1:01:12.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸死在外边, 他试图去保护她们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father died outside, trying to fend them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.70,1:01:15.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我站在门口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stood at my door...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.70,1:01:19.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我想跑到我的侄女的房间时, 我发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about to run to my nieces'room when...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.20,1:01:28.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双胞胎女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twin girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.70,1:01:33.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才六岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barely 6 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.20,1:01:36.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像动物似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butchered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.20,1:01:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 被屠杀了 - 天哪！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...like animals.  - Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.20,1:01:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后想起的下件事, 就是我已经在他怀里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next thing I knew, I was in his arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.20,1:01:46.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争波及我们的住所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war had spilled into our house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.90,1:01:49.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经跟踪狼人好几天了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd been tracking the Lycans for days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.20,1:01:51.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他把那些人赶走也救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He drove them off and saved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.20,1:01:54.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁？ - 维克多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who?  - Viktor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.20,1:01:58.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当中最年长和最强壮的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oldest and strongest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.20,1:02:02.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那一夜, 他使我成为吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That night, he made me a Vampire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.20,1:02:05.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他给了我复仇的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave me the strength to avenge my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.20,1:02:09.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从那时候起, 我不再回忆过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since then, I've never looked back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.20,1:02:18.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过你的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw your pictures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.00,1:02:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人是谁？你的妻子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is the woman? Your wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.20,1:02:33.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许应该看紧一点我们的兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be wise to keep a closer eye on our cousins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.20,1:02:37.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让瑞兹去看着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have Raze see to it immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.90,1:02:41.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友, 我想我该相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that I'm going to have to place my faith in you, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.20,1:02:46.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is running short.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.20,1:02:50.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想转弯, 但他还是撞过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to swerve, but he hit us anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.20,1:02:54.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他正好把我们撞到反方向的单行道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sent us right into the oncoming lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.70,1:03:00.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我醒来的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I came to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.70,1:03:05.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我意识到引擎在前座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I realized that part of the engine was in the front seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.20,1:03:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而她被钉在那里, 离我6英寸的距离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she was pinned there, 6 inches from me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.20,1:03:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时情况很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in this horrible position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.20,1:03:23.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想她吓坏了, 因为她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she was in shock because she just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.70,1:03:27.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一遍又一遍地问我是不是受伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...kept asking me over and over again if I was all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.20,1:03:31.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她更担心我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was more worried about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.20,1:03:39.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我如果能像现在一样清醒, 应该能救她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if I knew then what I know now, I could have saved her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:43.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未怀疑过这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no doubt in my mind about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.20,1:03:47.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但她终究离我而去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But instead she died right there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.20,1:03:52.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两分种后救护车赶到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about two minutes before the ambulance arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.20,1:04:00.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从那以后, 我便没有留恋的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, I didn't see any reason to stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.20,1:04:04.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我还小时, 在这跟我爷爷度过了一个夏天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent a summer here with my grandfather when I was a kid so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.20,1:04:09.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我毕业后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After I got my degree, I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.20,1:04:11.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就远走高飞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.90,1:04:19.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我搬到这里来以忘记一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came over here to move on, to forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.20,1:04:24.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时看来, 这是个不错的主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seemed like a good idea at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.20,1:04:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.20,1:04:32.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,忘记了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moved on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.70,1:04:35.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.70,1:04:48.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你对我将要告诉你的事, 守口如瓶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to keep what I'm about to tell you under the strictest confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.20,1:04:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.20,1:05:18.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁发动的战争？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who started the war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.70,1:05:20.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.70,1:05:24.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者至少我们得这样认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or at least that's what we've been led to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.90,1:05:27.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,挖掘历史是被禁止的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Digging into the past is forbidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.20,1:05:31.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be heading back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.70,1:05:32.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.20,1:05:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多知道怎么做, 我会回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor will know what to do. I'll come back tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.70,1:05:38.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我可不想一个人在这 - 想活命就听话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I won't stay alone.  - You will if you want to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.60,1:05:40.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想和你一起走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.20,1:06:01.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.20,1:06:06.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当明天月圆的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the full moon rises tomorrow night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.70,1:06:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将会改变, 你将会去杀人, 你将会去饮血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you will change, you will kill, and you will feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.20,1:06:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不可避免的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unavoidable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.20,1:06:15.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你到处乱窜, 为所欲为, 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't leave you free to roam around. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.20,1:06:25.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一发子弹不会杀了你, 但银会防止变身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A single round won't kill you, but silver prevents transformation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.20,1:06:27.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少可以防止几个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least for a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.00,1:06:30.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没按时回来的话, 帮自己个忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't return in time, do yourself a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.50,1:06:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.10,1:07:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.60,1:07:59.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主人 她来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord. She's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.20,1:08:17.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这么对我？让我这样难堪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you do this to me? Embarrass me like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.70,1:08:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整个家族都知道我们有个计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire coven knows that I had plans for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.20,1:08:24.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有什么"我们" - 你得去维克多那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is no us!  - You'll go before Viktor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.50,1:08:30.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他我对你说的话, 从现在起, 你要按我说的做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and tell him exactly what I tell you to! From here on out, you'll do as I say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.00,1:08:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么不清楚的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that in any way unclear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.70,1:09:22.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来, 近点, 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come closer, my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.70,1:09:26.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.90,1:09:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点, 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.20,1:09:40.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你我迷失了方向, 主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been lost without you, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.40,1:09:45.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩不停地纠缠我, 并乐此不疲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Constantly hounded by Kraven and his never-ending infatuation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.20,1:09:50.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是书中最古老的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the oldest story in the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.20,1:09:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想拥有一样他得不到的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He desires the one thing he cannot have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.20,1:10:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在, 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.20,1:10:05.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你相信卢西恩仍活着？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why have you come to believe that Lucian still lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.20,1:10:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 - 我给了你所需要的全部证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah.  - I've given you all the proof you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.20,1:10:15.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是些不连贯的思绪和影像而已, 没有别的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoherent thoughts and images, nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.50,1:10:19.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那正是为何唤醒得由长老来完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is precisely why the Awakening is performed by an elder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.50,1:10:21.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有具备所需的技能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not possess the necessary skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.70,1:10:25.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我的确看见卢西恩了, 还打了他, 相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I did see Lucian. I shot him. You must believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.30,1:10:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,惯例从来没被破坏过, 一次都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chain has never been broken. Not once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.30,1:10:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十四个世纪都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in 14 centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.50,1:10:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我们这些老家伙交替出现以来, 就没有过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not since we elders first began to leapfrog through time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.70,1:10:38.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个醒着, 两个沉睡着, 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One awake, two asleep. That's the way of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.20,1:10:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是马库斯统治的时代, 不是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Marcus' turn to reign, not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.70,1:10:44.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 事情有点复杂  - 但我没有选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's been a complication.  - But I had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.50,1:10:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,家族处于危险之中, 迈克尔是关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coven is in danger, and Michael is the key...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.50,1:10:52.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.20,1:10:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.20,1:10:58.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.70,1:11:01.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我机会让我去搞到你要的证据吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the chance to get proof you require.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.50,1:11:02.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.00,1:11:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让克莱恩去搜集证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will leave it to Kraven to collect the proof...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.20,1:11:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果确实有的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if there is any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.20,1:11:14.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你信任他多于信任我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you trust him over me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.20,1:11:19.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他没有被动物感染{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he is not the one who has been tainted by an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.10,1:11:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.20,1:11:30.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像爱女儿一样, 但你让我没有选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...like a daughter, but you leave me with no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.20,1:11:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些规矩的存在一定有其合理的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These rules are in place for a good reason...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.20,1:11:38.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且那也是我们活这么久的唯一理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and they are the only reason we have survived this long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.20,1:11:46.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你连一丁点的仁慈都不会得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not be shown an ounce of leniency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.70,1:11:52.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿米莉亚来了以后, 理事会将开会决定你的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Amelia arrives, the Council will convene and decide your fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.20,1:11:57.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你破坏了惯例, 破坏了盟约！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have broken the chain and the Covenant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.20,1:11:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该受到审判！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be judged!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.20,1:12:27.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该听我的话, 别再管这事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've listened to me and stayed out of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:31.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你运气好, 也许我能说服理事会宽恕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you'll be lucky if I can convince the Council to spare your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.20,1:12:33.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.70,1:12:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你从卢西恩手臂上割下那块皮, 还是卢西恩自己割的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have the nerve to cut the skin from his arm, or did Lucian do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.20,1:12:46.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记着我的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark my words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.70,1:12:49.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久, 你就会用我的眼光看待问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, you'll be seeing things my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.20,1:13:02.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不许开门, 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one opens this door. Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.20,1:13:09.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让我未来的女王和那个狼人再次私奔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't afford to have my future queen run off with that Lycan again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.50,1:13:49.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.20,1:14:03.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,改变计划, 索伦和他的小队会把阿米莉亚接来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change of plans. Amelia will be picked up by Soren and his team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.20,1:14:07.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是我们的工作！ - 从现在起不是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's our job.  - Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.70,1:17:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么你要帮我？ - 不, 我是在帮我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you helping me?  - I'm not. I'm helping me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.20,1:17:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 发生什么了？ - 警报器被触动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on?  - The perimeter sensor's been tripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.20,1:17:47.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正封锁整座楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're locking down the mansion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.20,1:17:52.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是瑟琳娜, 她跑了, 去找迈克尔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Selene. She's escaped, to go to him, to Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.10,1:17:56.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把那个狼人的头提来见我！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that Lycan's head on a plate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.20,1:19:30.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.20,1:20:00.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蹲下！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.20,1:20:05.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快, 走！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.20,1:20:14.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 跳啊！ - 你不是跟我开玩笑吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jump. - Are you fucking kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.20,1:21:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有消息吗？ - 只是假警报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any luck?  - False alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.20,1:21:44.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有东西靠近围栏, 那些狗早就扑上去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dogs would've been all over it if anything had gotten near that fence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.70,1:21:48.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿米莉亚应该已经到了 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Amelia should have arrived by now.  - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.20,1:21:56.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着, 你离开这, 去看看什么事情耽搁了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I want you to slip off the property and find out what's keeping her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.70,1:21:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.20,1:22:39.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们应该停车给他吃点药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should pull over and dose him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.70,1:22:42.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狗屁, 他会没事的, 我们就快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck him. He'll be all right. We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.20,1:23:52.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢, 该死！他不行了, 停车, 停车！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. He's not gonna make it. Pull over. Pull over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.50,1:24:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿工具包来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the kit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.50,1:24:27.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他打针 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick him. Stick him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.20,1:24:41.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.20,1:24:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor wants to speak with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.20,1:25:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.50,1:25:18.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让人去叫瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent for Selene...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.90,1:25:21.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是叫你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.20,1:25:25.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她违抗你的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's defied your orders...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.90,1:25:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这里逃出去了, 主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and fled the mansion, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.50,1:25:33.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的无能现在最让我费神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your incompetence is becoming most taxing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.70,1:25:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我的错, 她很坚持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault. She's become obsessed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.70,1:25:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,认为我是某个荒谬阴谋的主使者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...thinks that I'm at the core of some ridiculous conspiracy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.20,1:25:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here's my proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.20,1:26:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在, 你把你跟我说的话, 再跟他们说一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I want you to tell them exactly what you told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.20,1:26:10.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧, 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.20,1:26:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直在找一个特殊的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been searching for someone with a special trait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.20,1:26:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大·柯文纳斯的后裔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A direct descendant of Alexander Corvinus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.20,1:26:25.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,匈牙利人, 一个军阀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Hungarian, a warlord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.20,1:26:29.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在五世纪初的时候掌权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who came to power in the early seasons of the fifth century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.20,1:26:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恰好目睹瘟疫毁灭了他的村庄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in time to watch a plague ravage his village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.20,1:26:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有他一人活了下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He alone survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.20,1:26:48.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知为何, 他的身体可以改变疾病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow, his body was able to change the disease...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.20,1:26:51.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,使其对他自身有益{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...mold it to his benefit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.20,1:26:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他成为了第一个真正的不死者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He became the first true immortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.20,1:27:09.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,许多年之后, 他至少有了两个孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And years later, he fathered at least two children...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.20,1:27:12.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这两个孩子也都继承了相同的特性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who inherited this same trait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.50,1:27:15.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大·柯文纳斯家族的男孩们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sons of the Corvinus clan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.00,1:27:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个被蝙蝠咬了, 一个被狼咬了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One bitten by bat, one by wolf...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.00,1:27:24.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个像人一样…独自走在由生到死的路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one to walk the lonely road of mortality as a human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.70,1:27:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是个荒唐的传说, 仅此而已 - 可能吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a ridiculous legend. Nothing!  - That may be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.20,1:27:36.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们的种族的确有一个共同的祖先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but our species do have a common ancestor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.20,1:27:39.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个原病毒的异变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mutation of the original virus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.20,1:27:41.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和他的血脉有直接的关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is directly linked to his bloodline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.70,1:27:46.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿, 躺着一个柯文纳斯的后裔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a descendant of Corvinus lying there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.20,1:27:50.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离你不足三英尺远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not three feet from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.20,1:27:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.60,1:27:57.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他已是个吸血鬼了, 我们需要纯正的来源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's already a Vampire. We needed a pure source...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.20,1:28:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该没受过污染, 和最初的病毒完全一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...untainted. An exact duplicate of the original virus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.20,1:28:06.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种元素, 我们知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which we learned...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.70,1:28:10.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是藏于他人类后代的基因密码中的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was hidden away in the genetic code of his human descendants...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.50,1:28:15.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并且以潜伏的形式传递下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and passed along in its latent form...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.50,1:28:19.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自古到今{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...down through the ages...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.50,1:28:25.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到传给了迈克尔·柯文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all the way to Michael Corvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.20,1:28:31.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多年来, 我们都在试图混和两个种族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years, we tried to combine their bloodlines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.20,1:28:37.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年来我们都失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for years we failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.70,1:28:40.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是没用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.80,1:28:46.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的两个种族, 连细胞都互相残杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even at the cellular level, our species seemed destined to destroy each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.20,1:28:55.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到我们找到迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is, until we found Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.20,1:29:02.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的血能带来完美的结合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Corvinus strain allows for a perfect union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.20,1:29:08.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三细胞血小板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A triple-celled platelet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.70,1:29:13.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拥有不可言语的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which holds unspeakable power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.20,1:29:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能有完美的结合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There can be no such union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.70,1:29:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就连提及到这个都是异端邪教 - 走着瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And to speak of it is heresy.  - We'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.20,1:29:28.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦卢西恩给他自己注射了迈克尔的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once Lucian has injected himself with Michael's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.20,1:29:31.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.20,1:29:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁说的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.20,1:29:47.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你替我做些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to do something for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.20,1:29:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证, 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assure you, my child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.20,1:29:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩将会偿命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Kraven will pay with his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.20,1:30:23.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久, 这所房子将会成为废墟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, this house will lie in ruins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.20,1:30:27.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过你会先完蛋 - 不, 等等, 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not before you.  - No, wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.70,1:30:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你, 只有你自己将会知道这一事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and you alone will know the truth of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.20,1:30:40.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果卢西恩能够得到一个纯种人的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Lucian was able to get his hands on the blood of a Pure-Born...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.70,1:30:45.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个像阿米莉亚一样强大的长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a powerful elder like Amelia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.50,1:30:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者, 是你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or yourself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.50,1:30:54.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和迈克尔的血一起注入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and inject it along with Michael's blood...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.20,1:30:55.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abomination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.70,1:30:57.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,半吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half-Vampire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.50,1:31:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,半狼人, 但是比各自都要强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...half-Lycan, but stronger than both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.20,1:31:24.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要和卡恩说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to speak with Kahn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.20,1:31:32.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.20,1:31:37.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理事会成员已经被暗杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Council members have been assassinated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.20,1:31:45.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿米莉亚怎么样了？ - 他们放光了她的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What of Amelia?  - They bled her dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.20,1:31:50.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has already begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.20,1:32:04.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为怀疑你感到抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I doubted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.20,1:32:10.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕, 我的孩子, 你将会得到赦免{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear not, my child, absolution will be yours...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.20,1:32:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你杀死了柯文纳斯的后代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the moment you kill the descendant of Corvinus, this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.20,1:32:20.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.20,1:32:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经给你注射了阻止变身的酶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been given an enzyme to stop the change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.20,1:33:06.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晕眩的状态一会儿就会消失的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may take a little time for the grogginess to dissipate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.20,1:33:14.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.20,1:33:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去看看瑞兹怎么还没来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go and see what's keeping Raze, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.20,1:33:21.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的要说抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really must apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.20,1:33:25.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他真的需要好好学学礼貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in desperate need of a lesson in manners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.20,1:33:29.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,讲到礼貌 我在哪里呢? 请原谅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of manners, where are mine? Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.70,1:33:31.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.20,1:33:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.20,1:33:39.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.20,1:33:43.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.20,1:33:46.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪儿都不能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.20,1:33:52.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼一看见你就会杀了你, 因为你是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Vampires will kill you on sight. Just for being what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.20,1:33:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当中的一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.20,1:34:00.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我们当中的一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.20,1:34:04.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.30,1:34:08.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在干什么？ - 让这场冲突结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing?  - Bringing an end to this conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.20,1:34:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的战争与我无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your war, it has nothing to do with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.20,1:34:20.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的战争？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.20,1:34:45.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.20,1:34:47.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.20,1:34:50.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.60,1:35:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.20,1:35:29.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不！不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.20,1:35:42.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.20,1:36:49.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们逼你看着她死去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They forced you to watch her die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.20,1:36:53.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.20,1:36:56.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是引起战争的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what started the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.50,1:37:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见它发生就像我身临其境一般{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it happen as if I were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.20,1:37:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾经是奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were slaves once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.70,1:37:16.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼白天的守卫者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The daylight guardians of the Vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.20,1:37:20.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我出生在奴隶的家庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born in servitude...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.50,1:37:25.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不憎恨吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...yet I harbored them no ill will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.50,1:37:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至娶了一个吸血鬼作我的新娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even took a Vampire for my bride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.20,1:37:32.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的结合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was forbidden...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.20,1:37:34.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是被禁止的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...our union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.20,1:37:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多害怕血统混合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor feared a blending of the species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.20,1:37:44.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feared it so much...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.50,1:37:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.50,1:37:50.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他自己的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His own daughter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.70,1:37:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活活烧死了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...burnt alive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.50,1:37:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是因为她爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for loving me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.20,1:38:03.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他的战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is his war...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.30,1:38:06.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Viktor's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.30,1:38:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他从六百年前就开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he's spent the last 600 years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.50,1:38:14.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,消灭我的族人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...exterminating my species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.20,1:38:18.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会对瑟琳娜做什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they gonna do to Selene?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.70,1:38:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有客人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.70,1:38:28.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想我们说好了的 - 耐心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought we had a deal.  - Patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.70,1:38:32.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kraven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.20,1:38:35.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些事应该私下谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are matters to be discussed in private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.20,1:38:40.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把我们的客人护送到楼下去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please escort our guests downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.20,1:39:00.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理事会被消灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Council has been destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.20,1:39:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很快就会得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, you will have it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.20,1:39:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伟大的族群以及和狼人达成的永久和平条约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both great covens and an ironclad peace treaty with the Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.20,1:39:15.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当战利品到手后, 我不会忘记那些我信任的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who I trust will not be forgotten when the spoils are tabulated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.20,1:39:18.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多已经醒了, 你以为我还能控制吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you expect me to assume control now that Viktor's awake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.20,1:39:22.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人能打败他, 我们说话时他正变得更强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no defeating him. He grows stronger as we speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.20,1:39:26.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么我需要迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is precisely why I need Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.20,1:39:29.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果维克多很容易就会被弄死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Viktor were so easy to dispatch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.70,1:39:33.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几世纪前, 你自己就会干掉他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'd have done it yourself centuries ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.20,1:39:48.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关闸！快！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exit shaft! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.20,1:39:50.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.20,1:40:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢, 他妈的！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.80,1:40:22.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是维克多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Viktor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.80,1:40:24.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.20,1:40:28.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你干好自己该干的事, 他仍旧在休眠中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you had done your job, he'd still be in hibernation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.20,1:40:36.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的, 瑞兹到底在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is Raze?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.20,1:40:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的出路吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there another way out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.20,1:40:47.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你从未想过…要流血才能赢得胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it didn't occur to you that you'll have to bleed to pull off this coup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.20,1:40:53.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别想逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.20,1:41:19.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,硝酸银！我打赌你没想到这点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silver nitrate. Bet you weren't expecting that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.20,1:41:31.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快, 快点！快上！快！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Move! Move! Move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.70,1:42:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.20,1:44:53.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.70,1:44:56.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.20,1:45:44.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.20,1:50:37.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带你走, 维克多就要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get you out. Viktor's on his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.00,1:50:39.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不希望一个狼人能活下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he won't be satisfied until every Lycan's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.20,1:50:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也会因为你帮了我而杀了你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll kill you too, just for helping me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.20,1:50:44.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.20,1:51:10.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道导致这场战争的原因了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what started the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.20,1:53:23.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了！跟我来！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough. You're coming with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.20,1:53:26.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我能活着看到维克多结束你的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope I live to see Viktor choke the life from you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.70,1:53:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌你会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.20,1:53:33.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但让我告诉你件事, 关于你深爱着的黑暗之父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let me tell you a little something about your beloved dark father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.20,1:53:36.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是杀死你全家的凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one who killed your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.20,1:53:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.20,1:53:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从不遵守自己定下的规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never could follow his own rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.20,1:53:43.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说无法忍受牲畜的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he couldn't abide the taste of livestock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.70,1:53:48.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他偶尔出去贪婪地喝人血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So every once in a while, he went out and gorged himself on human blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.20,1:53:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我替他保守秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kept his secrets...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.20,1:53:53.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收拾残局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...cleaned up the mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.20,1:53:54.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.20,1:53:56.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蹑手蹑脚地走进一个个房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who crept room to room...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.20,1:54:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死了你最亲的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...dispatching everyone close to your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.70,1:54:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是, 当他看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when he got to you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.20,1:54:07.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他忍不住想喝干你的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he just couldn't bear the thought of draining you dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.70,1:54:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是你让他想起了他最珍爱的索妮亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, who reminded him so much of his precious Sonja...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.70,1:54:17.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他亲手处决的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the daughter he condemned to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.20,1:54:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说谎 - 信不信由你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lies.  - Believe what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.20,1:54:24.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.70,1:54:27.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到我身边来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your place is by my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.20,1:54:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.20,1:55:06.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咬他！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bite him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.20,1:55:11.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,半吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half-Vampire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.20,1:55:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,半狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...half-Lycan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.20,1:55:17.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是比两个都要强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but stronger than both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.20,1:55:45.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.20,1:55:47.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以杀死我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may have killed me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.50,1:55:50.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,堂兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.00,1:55:53.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我的愿望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my will...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.00,1:55:55.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经实现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is done regardless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.20,1:56:37.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.20,1:56:39.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Kraven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.20,1:57:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我, 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.70,1:57:06.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't the Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.20,1:57:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.20,1:57:19.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.20,1:57:40.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能骗我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you bear my trust...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.10,1:57:43.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你杀了我全家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...knowing that you'd killed my family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.20,1:57:45.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.20,1:57:49.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从你身边夺走很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have taken from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.70,1:57:53.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我给你的更多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have given so much more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.20,1:57:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是公平交易吗？我赐予你生命永生的礼物？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it not a fair trade, the life I have granted you? The gift of immortality?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.20,1:58:01.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你女儿的生命？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the life of your daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.70,1:58:05.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己的骨肉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your own flesh and blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.80,1:58:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved my daughter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.20,1:58:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她怀了孽种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the abomination growing in her womb...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.20,1:58:37.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是对我和家族的背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was a betrayal of me and of the coven!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.20,1:58:45.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我所作的都是为了保护我的种族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what was necessary to protect the species...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.20,1:58:49.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我不得不再一次这么做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as I am forced to do yet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.20,1:58:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.20,2:01:48.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的死期到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.20,2:05:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我无法预言未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I cannot predict the future...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.70,2:05:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但今晚的结局会在以后的许多年中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the consequences of tonight will reverberate through the halls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.60,2:05:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给族里造成巨大影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of both great covens for many years to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.20,2:05:22.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个吸血鬼长老死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two Vampire elders have been slain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.70,2:05:24.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个是我亲手杀死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one by my own hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.10,2:05:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久马库斯将会继位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, Marcus will take the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.10,2:05:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨和报复将弥漫在夜空中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a tide of anger and retribution will spill out into the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.20,2:05:40.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,分歧将被消除{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Differences will be set aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.20,2:05:44.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人人都会效忠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allegiances will be made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.20,2:05:45.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And soon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.70,2:05:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将会被追杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will become the hunted.{\r}
